sequenceDiagram
    participant Timer as Interference Timer (1000ms)
    participant Monitor as Channel Monitor
    participant Analyzer as Interference Analyzer
    participant Adapter as Adaptive PHY Controller
    participant Broadcast as Broadcast Manager
    participant Scanner as Scanner Controller
    
    Note over Timer: 📊 干扰监控和自适应调整流程
    
    Timer->>Monitor: Check interference levels
    Monitor->>Monitor: Scan active channels
    Monitor->>Analyzer: Channel quality data
    
    Note over Analyzer: 🔍 Interference analysis
    Analyzer->>Analyzer: Calculate interference_score
    Analyzer->>Analyzer: Compare with threshold (75)
    
    alt High Interference Detected
        Analyzer-->>Adapter: 🚨 Interference > threshold
        
        Adapter->>Adapter: Evaluate current PHY
        
        alt Current PHY is 1M
            Adapter->>Adapter: Switch to Coded PHY
            Adapter->>Scanner: Update scan parameters<br/>(PHY_CODED)
            Adapter->>Broadcast: Update broadcast PHY
            Scanner-->>Adapter: ✅ PHY updated
            Broadcast-->>Adapter: ✅ Broadcast updated
        else Current PHY is Coded
            Adapter->>Adapter: Switch to 1M PHY
            Adapter->>Scanner: Update scan parameters<br/>(PHY_1M)
            Adapter->>Broadcast: Update broadcast PHY
            Scanner-->>Adapter: ✅ PHY updated
            Broadcast-->>Adapter: ✅ Broadcast updated
        end
        
        Note over Adapter: 📈 Performance optimization
        Adapter->>Adapter: Reset interference counters
        Adapter-->>Timer: ✅ Adaptation complete
        
    else Interference Within Limits
        Analyzer-->>Timer: ✅ No action needed
    end